# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's keep (stage 5m, from 5f's): the fourth level, the flame. A hall, two rows of pillars, a
# guard going round its middle; an aisle each side, the east one walked by a guard, the west one by no
# one. At the hall's north end an apse, the flame on its pedestal, a guard at the apse's mouth facing the
# hall: in by a side door, the flame is taken behind its back. Carried, it gives light: out by the other
# side door and down the west aisle (the hall's side door passed while the hall's guard looks away) to
# the postern. A scroll at each aisle's north end. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-4.plan).
title The keep
spawn 0 1 -2
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.12
sky 22.0

# Made from plans/level-4.plan (levelFromPlan, @manifold/kit): the floor, the walls, crates and pillars.
